## Lead-source taxonomy (EDIT THIS)

> The allowed `source` values for a lead — where it came from. `/lead` offers
> these. Default is a small generic set; replace it.

- `referral | inbound | event | outbound`  (default)

<!-- Real examples — pick/rename to match your business:
- referral    — a customer or partner sent them
- inbound     — they came to us (website, content, search)
- outbound    — we reached out cold
- event       — met at a conference / trade show / webinar
- partner     — came through a channel/partner
- expansion   — an existing customer, new opportunity
-->

